#, python-brace-format
msgid "reason “{reason}” differs from the one of the backup {name}, reason “{expected}”"
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນ “{reason}” ບໍ່ກົງກັບເຫດຜົນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງ {name} ຄື “{expected}”"

